title: Slow Jam in Six
key: Fm
tempo: 60
meter: 6/8
style: neosoul

// A minor slow jam in six-eight: two slow pulses to the bar, three eighths in
// each. Thirty-two bars, AABA. The A goes from the one to the six and the four
// and home by the five, with a minor two-five in its seventh bar. The bridge
// opens on the relative major and falls back to the one by its two-five, then
// takes a two-five to the six and another to the relative major, and comes back
// by the minor two-five.
[A]
| Fm9 | Dbmaj9 | Bbm9       | C7#9 |
| Fm9 | Dbmaj9 | Gm7b5 C7b9 | Fm9  |

[A]

[Bridge]
| Abmaj9 | Gm7b5 C7b9 | Fm9    | Ebm9 Ab13  |
| Dbmaj9 | Bbm9 Eb13  | Abmaj9 | Gm7b5 C7b9 |

[A]
